    "content": "<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><style type=\"text/css\" style=\"display:none;\"> P {margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;} </style></head><body dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Hi Alex,</div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">The security review of the file upload service is complete. Summary:<ul><li><b>High</b>: uploaded file names are not normalised before they are written to the log</li><li><b>Medium</b>: upload tokens stay valid for 24 hours; recommend 1 hour</li><li><b>Low</b>: error responses include the internal service version</li></ul></div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Full report: <a href=\"https://example.com/security/reviews/file-upload\">https://example.com/security/reviews/file-upload</a>. We'd like a plan for the high finding by October 23.</div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Thanks,<br>Emery</div></body></html>"
